# Admin API — HTTP Client (JetBrains / VS Code REST Client)
# Base URL: use your backend URL, e.g. http://localhost:8000 or https://your-api.com
# After running "Admin Login", copy the "token" from the response into @token below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@jobs.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Admin Me (authenticated — set @token from login response first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin Logout (authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
